message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "academic-paper-polish: An agent skill for academic paper writing, polishing, journal matching, and reviewer response"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform agent skill that encodes hard rules for writing and submitting
  geoscience SCI papers and degree theses: journal-specific structural constraints,
  inverted-pyramid introductions, citation-density tables, figure and table hard
  parameters, submission workflows, and reviewer-response techniques.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "syxscott"
repository-code: "https://github.com/syxscott/academic-paper-polish"
url: "https://github.com/syxscott/academic-paper-polish"
